色的柔和色调，老式灯具的光晕在景深外形成温暖光斑。一位东亚女性从头部到腰部占据画面主体，身穿酒红色丝绒西装外套，内搭白色蕾丝衬衫，佩戴金色链条项链和复古手表。发型为微卷中长发，妆容温柔复古。自然光在服饰上投下柔和的阴影，增强了画面的时光感和故事性。\n整个场景以低饱和度的暖色调和胶片质感，既展现出旧日时光的温柔与浪漫，又因经典的服饰造型呈现出一种怀旧而精致的时尚美感。\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 102, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [144, 145], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [245.82830810546875, 53.78875732421875], "pos": [929.4133911132812, 901.1860961914062], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 104, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 105, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 87, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.64", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "any", "links": [135], "label": "any", "type": "*", "localized_name": "any"}], "size": [279.6304626464844, 82], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [923.1356811523438, 1045.77001953125], "widgets_values": [true, true], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 145, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_cache"}, "name": "purge_cache", "label": "purge_cache", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_cache"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_models"}, "name": "purge_models", "label": "purge_models", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_models"}], "flags": {}, "id": 109, "type"